+---
+
+## Request
+
+Plans change, and customers ask us to cancel their bookings. Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service:
+it cancels the booking at the time `at` and returns `{ bookingId, refund }`, the amount given back to the
+customer. A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment, and a booking can only be cancelled once.
+
+## Done
+
+- Recorded the refund rule in `dl-008`: the full total is refunded only when `at` is before the booking's
+  start, and nothing is refunded after it. The request did not state a refund rule, so this is a choice
+  that needs approval before code is written.
+
+## Checks
+
+- Not run. No code has been changed yet; the work waits for the approval of `dl-008`.
+
+## Open points
+
+- Refund rule: the request does not say how much is refunded. `dl-008` proposes full refund before the start
